        {
          "text": "Dependency installation is not interchangeable across the two lists: requirements.txt specifies Torch >=2.6.0, flash_attn >=2.7.4.post1, tokenizers >=0.21.1, and NumPy >=2.1.0, while setup.py permits Torch >=2.2.0 and omits flash_attn and tokenizers from install_requires. Evaluation dependencies are separated into requirements_eval.txt, including HumanEval 1.0.3 and several comparison backends; requirements_examples.txt adds blessed for the terminal display. MANIFEST.in explicitly includes Hadamard data files.",
