        {
          "text": "The documented conversion interface is python convert.py -i <input_dir> -o <output_dir> -w <working_dir> -b <bitrate>. The working directory holds checkpoints and quantized tensors pending compilation and should fit an output-model copy. Resumption requires an explicit -r/--resume, unlike the documented EXL2 default. These instructions connect users to conversion; they do not demonstrate conversion speed or successful recovery.",
