        {
          "text": "eval/ppl.py measures next-token likelihood on Wikitext-2 raw test text joined with double newlines. It tokenizes with the loaded model's tokenizer, makes 2048-token windows at stride 512, defaults to 100 rows, and forwards each window without a KV cache using flash_attn_nc. It slices logits to the actual vocabulary, applies float32 log_softmax, gathers the following token's log probability, and reports exp(-sum(log probability)/target count). Every window contributes all 2047 next-token targets; overlapping targets are not masked away.",
