        {
          "text": "eval/humaneval.py generates code-completion samples and optionally delegates functional checking to evaluate_functional_correctness. Defaults are 200 samples per task, top_p=0.6, temperature=0.6, and a 768-token cap; jobs use token healing, a six-token minimum, EOS stopping, and a generator batch limit of 256. The collector additionally ends a sample at a non-indented final line, cancels unfinished jobs, and writes task_id/completion records to JSONL. Prompt formatting and this extraction heuristic are part of the evaluation protocol. Merely generating the file does not establish functional correctness or a pass rate.",
